{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、私からの質問に答えてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございます！(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの色々なことがわかって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです(*^_^*)有難うっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、素敵なところでお仕事させて頂きました ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"置物がすごく可愛かったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮っちゃいました(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は、お仕事帰り一人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美術館へ行ってきました( *^_^* )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、すごく大好きで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに西洋美術にとても興味を持っています＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「  ドビュッシー、音楽と美術 ー 印象派と象徴派のあいだで  」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身、吹奏楽をずっとやってきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラシックとか西洋の芸術音楽が大好きなんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスを代表する音楽家、ドビュッシーの生誕150年を記念して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オルセー美術館、オランジュリー美術館、ブリヂストン美術館が共同開催する展覧会ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり興味深いものがあり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな音楽と、美術のクロスオーバーを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に行きたい！と思っていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見に行けて、嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドビュッシーが生きた19世紀～20世紀初頭のフランスを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肌で感じることができて、面白かったし、楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして、絵を見たあとで音楽を聴くと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し変わってくるのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また色々と聴いてみようと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の素晴らしい品々を拝見することが出来て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"厳かで美しい 世界観に癒されて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心が洗われた感じがします＾＾（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！ 元気チャージっ(o^^o) ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の握手会、楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださる方は、よろしくお願いします（＿）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、またね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}